# A &T? from a manager comes from try in front of the value: without it the line gives a &T.

### A box.
entity Box
    value: S64

### Makes a box.
### :param value: The value to hold.
### :returns: The box.
common routine Box.construct(value: S64) -> Me
    return Me(value)

### Borrows a &Box? without try.
routine start() -> None
    q: &Box? <- Box.construct(value: 1) from HEAP
    return
